 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Secure Source Manager API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Instances and repositories are configuration metadata: no Git server, web interface, host name or repository URI exists, and instances report ACTIVE immediately. Repository initialConfig is refused because no Git content is stored, and the instance field is stored as given. Listing repositories by instance and allowMissing deletes are refused. Long-running operations complete synchronously and remain readable through operations.get/list.",
  "title": "Secure Source Manager (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "v1"
 },
